<title>USA: GOLF-SECOND ROUND SCORES FROM THE TOUR CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SECOND ROUND SCORES FROM THE TOUR CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Oklahoma 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round scores</p>
<p>from the $3 million Tour Championship at the 6,834-yard,</p>
<p>par-70 Southern Hills Country Club on Friday (players U.S.</p>
<p>unless noted):</p>
<p>133 Tom Lehman 66 67</p>
<p>137 Vijay Singh (Fiji) 66 71</p>
<p>138 Steve Stricker 70 68</p>
<p>140 Mark Calcavecchia 69 71, Tom Watson 70 70, Brad Faxon 68</p>
<p>72, Steve Jones 67 73</p>
