<p>144 Corey Pavin 71 73, Fred Funk 71 73, Michael Bradley 71 73</p>
<p>145 Mark O'Meara 74 71, Greg Norman (Australia) 73 72, Jeff</p>
<p>Sluman 71 74</p>
